Implementation is already in place and verified — no further changes were needed.

`src/temperature.js` now exports both conversions:

```js
/** Celsius -> Fahrenheit, rounded to one decimal. */
export function toFahrenheit(c) {
  return Math.round(((c * 9) / 5 + 32) * 10) / 10;
}
```

`npm test` (`node --test`) passes 3/3 with 0 failures — the freezing/boiling assertions and the `-40 / 68 / 98.6` round-trips all compare exactly, so the unrounded fallback from the plan was not necessary. No file under `test/` was touched.
